  "category": "Settlement",
  "selectLabel": "Settlement: Cultural Touchstones",
  "description": "These touchstones represent common beliefs or practices of a community — not universal truths. Individuals can contradict these assumptions, or you might find groups of people in a single community with opposing touchstones.",
  "postamble": "Use the Type, Condition, and First Look oracles when initially sighting or revealing a settlement. If unsure of how its leaders or inhabitants react to your character—or to visitors in general—check the Disposition oracle.\n\nProjects are the main industry, function, or current focus of a settlement. They do not necessarily represent every activity at the site, but are the most visible or noteworthy aspects. Meanwhile, the Troubles oracle provides a broad description of the site's most dramatic current issues, and the Cultural Touchstones oracle reveals aspects of the community that you might learn while spending time there.",
